# Agent Chat Entry

## Metadata

```yaml
format: uimd
format-version: 1
kind: component
status: draft
description: "Fixed-height simulated agent chat entry for prose and structured transcript blocks."
tags: [component, simulation]
```

## Definition

```yaml
extends: uicontrol
```

## Members

```yaml
role:
  type: label
  text: Agent
  description: "Simulated transcript speaker or activity type."

phase:
  type: label
  text: response
  description: "Deterministic scenario phase."

body:
  type: spanlabel
  text: ""
  description: "Selectable simulated transcript content."

detail:
  type: label
  text: "simulated · no external action"
  description: "Simulation-only activity detail."
```

## Style

```yaml
this:
  border-width: 0
  background: "#00000000"
@header:
  background: "#162033"
  padding: 0, 1, 0, 1
@role:
  color: "#a7f3d0"
@phase:
  color: "#c4b5fd"
  text-align: right
@body_panel:
  background: "#0b1220"
  padding: 1, 1, 1, 1
@body:
  color: "#d1d5db"
  word-wrap: false
  user-select: text
@footer:
  background: "#111827"
  padding: 0, 1, 0, 1
@detail:
  color: "#64748b"
  user-select: text
```

